Well, it works both ways.  In fact, *you* as a purple worm is more powerful
than a regular purple worm.  I remember this sequence:

Possogronoe gets angry! -more-
You swallow Possoegronoe. -more-
You digest Possoegronoe. -more-
You totally digest Possoegronoe. -more-

To be fair to the monsters, they should perhaps be allowed to attack you from
inside while digesting you, but I don't think your stomach can take the heat
of an angry shopkeeper...  Imagine:

You swallow the priest of Moloch. -more-
The priest of Molock zaps a wand of digging! -more-
Your stomach splits open! -more-
You die... -more-

Or, even more interesting...

You swallow the soldier! -more-
The soldier wields a cockatrice corpse! -more-
The soldier hits you with the cockatrice corpse. -more-
[The stoning sequence]
You have turned to stone... -more-
You die... -more-

